<title>Syria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/syria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-syria-2026-10-14T06:20:04.354Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 14 Oct 2026 06:20:04 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Syrian security forces are intensifying anti-ISIS raids, targeting former regime loyalists and employing private security firms linked to a new Syrian security mogul while disrupting drug-smuggling attempts on the Iraq and Jordan borders. Israeli drones struck a Syrian operative planning attacks for Iran near the Lebanon border, prompting a UN Security Council call for respect of the 1974 Disengagement Agreement. The Syrian army began destroying chemical weapons stockpiles and the UK allocated $90 million to support Syria's economic recovery. Jordan and Syria’s foreign ministers discussed bilateral ties and regional developments, and 2,732 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxNT291Y1V5blpNRHJ4WGpHOG14M21WUnIxcWhzM1BJZGlSYUFaUUpqMFJucU5PM0lrcTRiRHhGcDBxSU82U2M0N2JVdTdBbEt6a0Jzam9CX0hsUThLZWJxXzFhXzVhTkVtalAtWEtxOU4xUml6WWd1ZTBGQ3JxenJkVzREUkdZM2ZWWlJmSUlRUUJkcTQydm1IbHhUUjZDYk90Q056MWtxblJjLS1vczBRbE9CN250dw?oc=5&quot;&gt;OCHA&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxOSFZHbk9NcWs5QUhRNERvanZfZzJXT0pEcExfSzV1TXczeklTVVZCakRWSU9vLXhEYXRpYWhxMlIxeUh4anRmdU8zOHFTSmd6VG51a3RzMnY4ajVEbW84TE4zUUxfSkl1UXN6NzVHNHJWY3o2U1lGSFFiSU55ajRMYU5DakJRN0tFc1o2RnhFTzBQdWZaa0pkdTBiclNEZGFXM3h3TTBIS2Fsdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The National&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVkFVX3lxTE9EeThjSEhCVmdqMkJxMWRtU1JlcTJXeWdpUFUwQnlWZkNLdVJwVGZfQ3VHVzhMd1hmc0puemxxOF9TWVZ1eVFZdXdSSUt3QWZkUzByV2hR?oc=5&quot;&gt;Ynetnews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxPQjM2MnVRN2p2MURLRXFPYmFkM1ZidF9DMk1GWGVGQVZsZGlQWFl5SHpUMEsyN050bHRDYWh1aVhNeG9Cb1pVSkE4S2hpenFYdXJ2Wnh1ZjM5Y1lyMWww